Seeking Greenlights: yes.

Page Type: SCP Article

Genre (Optional): History

Page Layout (Optional): Firstly scp class, special containment prodcedures, description and 3 addendums

Elevator Pitch: An scp that resembles old writing machine, but is able to speak via writing on paper, machine has been used by many people and has big knowledge of world, sometimes it starts writing some weird things.

Central Narrative: Foundation worker brings his old machine from museum and it starts to write to staff in office, who use it, some staff write back and machine starts to trust them. Later tells some secrets of other scps to staff. Finaly, when machine has got many people trust, O5s decide to limit of use of scp and its upgraded to euclid.

Hook/Attention-Grabber: Machine tells intresting stories of its orgins and helps trusted staff on their work.

Additional Notes: I do not naturaly speak English and i know this post is full of spelling mistakes. Also its my first idea.







